{
  "behavior": [
    "Inconclusive observations preserve a previously delivered, unexpired deadline bound and cannot supply new grant eligibility.",
    "Unsubmitted fresh or renewal proposals can be withdrawn without restoring expired, released or definitively retired holds.",
    "Cancellation and permitted completion belong to the original reservation. Refused duplicate submissions do not reset the winning event or write.",
    "The actual worker decision boundary signals a shortening after releasing State and shares a single signal when it also publishes a grant."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Injected wait and membership results exercised the repaired behavior. No naturally occurring observation failure or old-code negative run was recorded.",
    "Worker signaling used its real event in the native suites. The reply regression modeled completion with an actual event and a test closure, without a second native overlapped write.",
    "This records selected correctness checks and repository-style lint. It establishes no full stock release qualification, whole manual speed acceptance, parity, ranking or comparative performance.",
    "Full raw streams, source snapshots and original event selections stay private. The report supplies their byte counts and digests."
  ],
